cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use d-raft in published work, please cite this software."
title: "d-raft: Deterministic simulation infrastructure for consensus protocols"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mohammadamin
    family-names: Khanbabaei
    alias: aminkbi
    website: "https://github.com/aminkbi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft"
url: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  d-raft is a deterministic discrete-event simulation kernel for repeatable
  testing and research on Raft and other distributed state machines. It
  provides virtual time, stable random streams, a faultable typed network, and
  a versioned machine-readable execution trace.
keywords:
  - Raft
  - consensus
  - distributed systems
  - deterministic simulation
  - fault injection
  - reproducibility
